(3052444, 430402, 19982, '<td valign="top">The splash of red really adds to this image.  Love how the stairs and the lines in the walls lead up to her.  Excellent use of light.</td>', 'The splash of red really adds to this image.  Love how the stairs and the lines in the walls lead up to her.  Excellent use of light.', '2006-11-22 00:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
