(3053614, 429993, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice colors.  I actually like the ''smoothness'' in this shot and think that with the texture more discernible, would change the feel of the shot completely - still another good shot, just different.  Maybe the bottom left cropped out may have made this even better, but it does add to the balance.  Good angle with the upper leaves/stems/bokeh visible in the background, enhancing the perspective.  Perhaps a little more in/filling up the frame, else more of a square framing may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Nice clean and ''crisp'' feel to it.  Like your title.</td>', '8 - Nice colors.  I actually like the ''smoothness'' in this shot and think that with the texture more discernible, would change the feel of the shot completely - still another good shot, just different.  Maybe the bottom left cropped out may have made this even better, but it does add to the balance.  Good angle with the upper leaves/stems/bokeh visible in the background, enhancing the perspective.  Perhaps a little more in/filling up the frame, else more of a square framing may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Nice clean and ''crisp'' feel to it.  Like your title.', '2006-11-22 07:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3053625, 430420, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely dramatic ....... love the far away misty blue with the silhouetted trees ... and then the closer ''harsh'' red tones with the yellow highlights .. =9 .. the more i look at this photo the more i just love it ..... the misty blue makes me think ethereal and out of this world ......... what i also particularly like is the way the shadows create the perspective .....</td>', 'absolutely dramatic ....... love the far away misty blue with the silhouetted trees ... and then the closer ''harsh'' red tones with the yellow highlights .. =9 .. the more i look at this photo the more i just love it ..... the misty blue makes me think ethereal and out of this world ......... what i also particularly like is the way the shadows create the perspective .....', '2006-11-22 07:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3053629, 430295, 67145, '<td valign="top">love the graphic and contrasty look ...</td>', 'love the graphic and contrasty look ...', '2006-11-22 07:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
