(3053646, 428647, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the potential and good perspective.  Background elements are too distracting in my opinion.  More importantly, the quality does not seem to be there, as well as a bit of blur.  Focus seems to be sharpest on the legs, so adjusting that, especially to include the face/eyes and trying to gain more stop motion, make this better in my opinion.  Also, bigger (640 height) and a variation in crop, even if you still preferred it with the ears chopped - but then, depends what you had to work with, obviously.</td>', '4 - Like the potential and good perspective.  Background elements are too distracting in my opinion.  More importantly, the quality does not seem to be there, as well as a bit of blur.  Focus seems to be sharpest on the legs, so adjusting that, especially to include the face/eyes and trying to gain more stop motion, make this better in my opinion.  Also, bigger (640 height) and a variation in crop, even if you still preferred it with the ears chopped - but then, depends what you had to work with, obviously.', '2006-11-22 07:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
