(3054034, 429993, 65592, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful picture, almost zen in its simplicity!!<br/>Unfortunately you cut the top of the leave and it has little to do with the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-29 10:04:05.</i></td>', 'Very beautiful picture, almost zen in its simplicity!!Unfortunately you cut the top of the leave and it has little to do with the challenge.', '2006-11-22 10:35:24.000000', '2006-11-29 10:04:05.000000', 1),
(3054059, 428814, 65592, '<td valign="top">The black mass on the top is too prominent! <br/>Rule of thirds will help this picture to achieve a higher score IMO.<br/>On the other hand i like this idea a lot.</td>', 'The black mass on the top is too prominent! Rule of thirds will help this picture to achieve a higher score IMO.On the other hand i like this idea a lot.', '2006-11-22 10:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054084, 429962, 68256, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective....nice frame, tone, texture and composition.</td>', 'Interesting perspective....nice frame, tone, texture and composition.', '2006-11-22 10:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054087, 429097, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very clean and good job on traditional perspective.</td>', 'Very clean and good job on traditional perspective.', '2006-11-22 10:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054106, 430471, 68256, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the angles in this picture although I can''t explain why...I seem to be in chaos and less grounded when looking at it.  I also don''t love the warm tone.  Maybe a dark frame would have kept my eyes in it?</td>', 'I personally don''t like the angles in this picture although I can''t explain why...I seem to be in chaos and less grounded when looking at it.  I also don''t love the warm tone.  Maybe a dark frame would have kept my eyes in it?', '2006-11-22 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054115, 428881, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective shot.  The lighting was very harsh but you did a good job balancing it out.  Very clean and not too busy for me.  I think the angleing sidewalk at the bottom of the picture matching the purple point of whatever it is makes this composition very interesting.  Good job</td>', 'Very nice perspective shot.  The lighting was very harsh but you did a good job balancing it out.  Very clean and not too busy for me.  I think the angleing sidewalk at the bottom of the picture matching the purple point of whatever it is makes this composition very interesting.  Good job', '2006-11-22 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054122, 430435, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view.  It reminds me of places just outside NYC.  Glad you survived! 7.</td>', 'Nice point of view.  It reminds me of places just outside NYC.  Glad you survived! 7.', '2006-11-22 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054124, 430246, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white.  Good balance and "perspective".  Simple compositions like this really appeal to me.  I do wish the horizon was a little straighter but that is a nitpicky thing to say :)</td>', 'Very nice black and white.  Good balance and "perspective".  Simple compositions like this really appeal to me.  I do wish the horizon was a little straighter but that is a nitpicky thing to say :)', '2006-11-22 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054127, 428089, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very pretty pussy cat.  The eyes are so much sharper than anything else around them.  Nice work. 7.</td>', 'Very pretty pussy cat.  The eyes are so much sharper than anything else around them.  Nice work. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054128, 429097, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegant in your photo''s simplicity. 7.</td>', 'Elegant in your photo''s simplicity. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054135, 430259, 51538, '<td valign="top">Always a pretty sight. 7.</td>', 'Always a pretty sight. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054137, 430346, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely creative interpretation.</td>', 'Nicely creative interpretation.', '2006-11-22 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054138, 429844, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Why only verticle borders?  My eyes follows the bench and leaves the photo...maybe a top border would have prevented that?  Anyway, I''m sure you had a good reason that is above me and the photo really works so who am I to say?  Ps. If someone says there is too much boring sky at the top left don''t believe them - the sky is a perfect compliment to the subject.</td>', 'Very nice!  Why only verticle borders?  My eyes follows the bench and leaves the photo...maybe a top border would have prevented that?  Anyway, I''m sure you had a good reason that is above me and the photo really works so who am I to say?  Ps. If someone says there is too much boring sky at the top left don''t believe them - the sky is a perfect compliment to the subject.', '2006-11-22 11:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054144, 428069, 68256, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain why this photo doesn''t just grab me and make me look and look...Maybe it is that the track is dead center, but then that is the POINT.  I''m sorry I can''t vote higher than a 6 for this because it is nice...</td>', 'I can''t explain why this photo doesn''t just grab me and make me look and look...Maybe it is that the track is dead center, but then that is the POINT.  I''m sorry I can''t vote higher than a 6 for this because it is nice...', '2006-11-22 11:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054147, 428686, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, the point of view, the subject - but if only the image was 640px wide. 7.</td>', 'I like the colours, the point of view, the subject - but if only the image was 640px wide. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054152, 430397, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice lucid image.</td>', 'Nice lucid image.', '2006-11-22 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054153, 430293, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and composition. 7.</td>', 'Lovely colours and composition. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054156, 428509, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer the glass not to be in the photo.  Otherwise, the fruit lends a delicate colouring to the image. 7.</td>', 'I think I would prefer the glass not to be in the photo.  Otherwise, the fruit lends a delicate colouring to the image. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054158, 428750, 68256, '<td valign="top">That is definately dramatic, but it just kills me to look at it.  My mind just will not accept it unless I treat it as an ink blot.  Please forgive my lack of vision.</td>', 'That is definately dramatic, but it just kills me to look at it.  My mind just will not accept it unless I treat it as an ink blot.  Please forgive my lack of vision.', '2006-11-22 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054165, 429529, 59442, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!</td>', 'I love this shot!', '2006-11-22 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054166, 430145, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of perspective.  The two glare (especially one being blue) spots distract a little from an otherwise great photo.  Thank you for placing the tomatoes within the lines of the table, it helps control my wondering eye.</td>', 'Great composition and use of perspective.  The two glare (especially one being blue) spots distract a little from an otherwise great photo.  Thank you for placing the tomatoes within the lines of the table, it helps control my wondering eye.', '2006-11-22 11:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054167, 429717, 65592, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective here!<br/>I always find difficult to avoid that kind of pictures to become flat images on a screen.</td>', 'Very good perspective here!I always find difficult to avoid that kind of pictures to become flat images on a screen.', '2006-11-22 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054168, 429328, 51538, '<td valign="top">Exciting image. 7.</td>', 'Exciting image. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054171, 430269, 65592, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds!!</td>', 'Rule of thirds!!', '2006-11-22 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054175, 429288, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried photos like this before and although you have done a much better job than me I still think it is too busy and no central subject so uninteresting.</td>', 'I''ve tried photos like this before and although you have done a much better job than me I still think it is too busy and no central subject so uninteresting.', '2006-11-22 11:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054184, 429288, 51538, '<td valign="top">View point and perspective.  You make me ponder these two terms.  I like your photo but as for the perspective element, I think this is more of a view point.  Perspective, as an idea, is enhanced if there are near and far objects, some of which are the same, so that the comparison in size can be seen. 6.</td>', 'View point and perspective.  You make me ponder these two terms.  I like your photo but as for the perspective element, I think this is more of a view point.  Perspective, as an idea, is enhanced if there are near and far objects, some of which are the same, so that the comparison in size can be seen. 6.', '2006-11-22 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054185, 429451, 68256, '<td valign="top">It looks over saturated to me and too much sky.  I''m thinking it would have been more interesting with a low perspective so there is more road leading the eyes and no people (or make the people the subject facing the camera).  Also it appears blotchy on my monitor, is that jpeg artifacts from too much compression?</td>', 'It looks over saturated to me and too much sky.  I''m thinking it would have been more interesting with a low perspective so there is more road leading the eyes and no people (or make the people the subject facing the camera).  Also it appears blotchy on my monitor, is that jpeg artifacts from too much compression?', '2006-11-22 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054188, 430481, 51538, '<td valign="top">Cloudy recently, yes?  The bridge was just not looking its best in the last two weeks - or at least it only did so in the last minutes of sunset as I was looking out my window.</td>', 'Cloudy recently, yes?  The bridge was just not looking its best in the last two weeks - or at least it only did so in the last minutes of sunset as I was looking out my window.', '2006-11-22 11:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054189, 430354, 68256, '<td valign="top">Too bad the seagull was cut off.  There is so much space between the gull and NYC that I can''t easily tie them together with my eyes.</td>', 'Too bad the seagull was cut off.  There is so much space between the gull and NYC that I can''t easily tie them together with my eyes.', '2006-11-22 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054193, 429216, 51538, '<td valign="top">Have I seen this before in the forums or in another challenge?  The Time Warner Center.  Maybe I am dreaming. Nice perspective though. 7.</td>', 'Have I seen this before in the forums or in another challenge?  The Time Warner Center.  Maybe I am dreaming. Nice perspective though. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054195, 428751, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught. 7.</td>', 'Nicely caught. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054205, 430299, 51538, '<td valign="top">View point and perspective seem to be different things to me.  I like the tint and the composition and the overall effect.  But the perspective element is elusive to me. 5.</td>', 'View point and perspective seem to be different things to me.  I like the tint and the composition and the overall effect.  But the perspective element is elusive to me. 5.', '2006-11-22 11:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054206, 430155, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the background is very distracting.  Maybe a shallower dof to isolate 1 particular aspect or taken from the oposite direction would have been more interesting to me.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the background is very distracting.  Maybe a shallower dof to isolate 1 particular aspect or taken from the oposite direction would have been more interesting to me.', '2006-11-22 11:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054213, 430397, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean, to bad about those towers in the sky huh?</td>', 'Nice and clean, to bad about those towers in the sky huh?', '2006-11-22 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054218, 430469, 68256, '<td valign="top">I typically don''t vote high for abstract architecture shots but you did a great job here.  The color is wonderful and it is so NOT flat.</td>', 'I typically don''t vote high for abstract architecture shots but you did a great job here.  The color is wonderful and it is so NOT flat.', '2006-11-22 11:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054220, 428489, 66727, '<td valign="top">It would be nice to see people more clearly inside</td>', 'It would be nice to see people more clearly inside', '2006-11-22 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054225, 429065, 68256, '<td valign="top">For some reason this composition isn''t very interesting to me.  The great big black bottom right corner and overall darkness along with not so straight horizontal I guess.  Maybe a central subject for the eyes to lock onto would have helped me.</td>', 'For some reason this composition isn''t very interesting to me.  The great big black bottom right corner and overall darkness along with not so straight horizontal I guess.  Maybe a central subject for the eyes to lock onto would have helped me.', '2006-11-22 11:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
