(3054402, 430259, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen so many boreing "looking up at tree" pictures but this one is really done well.  It has great perspective and is very clean.  Great job!</td>', 'I''ve seen so many boreing "looking up at tree" pictures but this one is really done well.  It has great perspective and is very clean.  Great job!', '2006-11-22 12:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054412, 429544, 31443, '<td valign="top">So there she is! Like the perspective here and the castle looks nice, well done</td>', 'So there she is! Like the perspective here and the castle looks nice, well done', '2006-11-22 12:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054417, 428649, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Imagine this photo without the rock in the foreground...it wouldn''t be nearly as effective.  Note to all landscape photographers -including myself - create perspective and depth with a foreground object...Of course it doesn''t hurt that you waited for the perfect lighting.</td>', 'Very nice!  Imagine this photo without the rock in the foreground...it wouldn''t be nearly as effective.  Note to all landscape photographers -including myself - create perspective and depth with a foreground object...Of course it doesn''t hurt that you waited for the perfect lighting.', '2006-11-22 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054428, 429880, 68256, '<td valign="top">Getting down and dirty helped this photo alot...good job with the perspective and framing.  In my mind this ranks higher than the other diminishing point railroad shots I''ve voted on.  The hill and the slight curve at the end help.  I do wish there was more interesting features other than the dark trees on the sides.....</td>', 'Getting down and dirty helped this photo alot...good job with the perspective and framing.  In my mind this ranks higher than the other diminishing point railroad shots I''ve voted on.  The hill and the slight curve at the end help.  I do wish there was more interesting features other than the dark trees on the sides.....', '2006-11-22 12:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054437, 429815, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very sureal, beatifull is all I can say.  A 10 if the water was - how can I say this - more watery?</td>', 'Very sureal, beatifull is all I can say.  A 10 if the water was - how can I say this - more watery?', '2006-11-22 12:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054443, 429633, 66494, '<td valign="top">My husband learned this lesson the hard way. Check out the tutorial on sizing, you''ll really appreciate it, and your scores will go way up too!</td>', 'My husband learned this lesson the hard way. Check out the tutorial on sizing, you''ll really appreciate it, and your scores will go way up too!', '2006-11-22 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054450, 430455, 68256, '<td valign="top">The dark spot in the upper right corner is pretty bad it really is a distraction and the first thing I see.  Otherwise good photo and maybe even better if it was straighter (may not be possible with distortion).</td>', 'The dark spot in the upper right corner is pretty bad it really is a distraction and the first thing I see.  Otherwise good photo and maybe even better if it was straighter (may not be possible with distortion).', '2006-11-22 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054454, 429058, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s beautiful!</td>', 'Wow that''s beautiful!', '2006-11-22 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054457, 427781, 68256, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the 2, I couldn''t make much out of the photo.  I can see the frog foot but other than that....</td>', 'Sorry for the 2, I couldn''t make much out of the photo.  I can see the frog foot but other than that....', '2006-11-22 12:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054458, 430166, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh this is fantastic!!!! What a great contrast of big and little and I love that there are people on the top of the cliff, really gives a sense of scale.</td>', 'Oh my gosh this is fantastic!!!! What a great contrast of big and little and I love that there are people on the top of the cliff, really gives a sense of scale.', '2006-11-22 12:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
