(3054478, 428757, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wished it was "cleaner".  Meaning if you could have pushed that first boat out with all those tie downs, removed the garden hose on the left and right, etc...I love the tone.</td>', 'Very nice.  I wished it was "cleaner".  Meaning if you could have pushed that first boat out with all those tie downs, removed the garden hose on the left and right, etc...I love the tone.', '2006-11-22 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
