(3054951, 429098, 68256, '<td valign="top">Another rock to anchor a landcape down, you guys are good!  I love the fade to nothing background.</td>', 'Another rock to anchor a landcape down, you guys are good!  I love the fade to nothing background.', '2006-11-22 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055005, 429288, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice shot that probably can''t be appreciated as much at this size.  A more refined crop, minimising or ''using more'' the reflections, as well as trying to get the fish to ''pop'' just a <i>fraction</i> more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Nice and clean and the colors seem natural.  Like the ''over'' perspective, but perhaps like to have seen it even <i>more</i> ''over''/direct, if possible - apologies in advance though if this <i>is</i> straight over the top.</td>', '7 - Nice shot that probably can''t be appreciated as much at this size.  A more refined crop, minimising or ''using more'' the reflections, as well as trying to get the fish to ''pop'' just a fraction more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Nice and clean and the colors seem natural.  Like the ''over'' perspective, but perhaps like to have seen it even more ''over''/direct, if possible - apologies in advance though if this is straight over the top.', '2006-11-22 14:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055020, 429844, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice image, toning works well, like the newspaper element.  A more refined crop, especially on the left, or else a little more included, may make this even better in my opinion.  Unusual framing does work, takes a bit of time to adjust / decide on, but your call anyway, obviously.</td>', '8 - Nice image, toning works well, like the newspaper element.  A more refined crop, especially on the left, or else a little more included, may make this even better in my opinion.  Unusual framing does work, takes a bit of time to adjust / decide on, but your call anyway, obviously.', '2006-11-22 15:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055035, 428832, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept but think a straightening and much tighter crop on each side to eliminate the distracting background elements, likely make this better in my opinion.  The colors / flags combined with the architecture style and color, make this seem to border on ''clashing''/busy too, but again, eliminating the background/sides and trying to ''use'' the unusual combinations, may have worked.  Otherwise, maybe a toning/b&amp;w - who knows.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept but think a straightening and much tighter crop on each side to eliminate the distracting background elements, likely make this better in my opinion.  The colors / flags combined with the architecture style and color, make this seem to border on ''clashing''/busy too, but again, eliminating the background/sides and trying to ''use'' the unusual combinations, may have worked.  Otherwise, maybe a toning/b&w - who knows.', '2006-11-22 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055037, 429897, 28064, '<td valign="top">Very clever, when it finally clicked in what I was looking at it was like wow.</td>', 'Very clever, when it finally clicked in what I was looking at it was like wow.', '2006-11-22 15:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055055, 428119, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good, just not sure on the white socks(?) and somewhat ''bland/studio'' background.</td>', '7 - Good, just not sure on the white socks(?) and somewhat ''bland/studio'' background.', '2006-11-22 15:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055057, 429225, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good potential, however the cat doesn''t look too happy/content to me.  Something funky going on mid to top left too in the ''black''.  Like the textures of the hair and fur, wish they were sharper/stronger.</td>', '6 - Good potential, however the cat doesn''t look too happy/content to me.  Something funky going on mid to top left too in the ''black''.  Like the textures of the hair and fur, wish they were sharper/stronger.', '2006-11-22 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055075, 430406, 50289, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and reflection on the rails.  Too bad the tracks didn''t turn toward the sun though.</td>', 'Nice colors and reflection on the rails.  Too bad the tracks didn''t turn toward the sun though.', '2006-11-22 15:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055078, 429673, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  Depending what you had to work with, a wider/squarer framing, more refined crop on the left and perhaps a little less fore/bottom oof areas, make this even better in my opinion.  Colors and oof lines/bokeh are nice.</td>', '6 - Like this.  Depending what you had to work with, a wider/squarer framing, more refined crop on the left and perhaps a little less fore/bottom oof areas, make this even better in my opinion.  Colors and oof lines/bokeh are nice.', '2006-11-22 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055083, 430259, 67152, '<td valign="top">the light on the trees makes this image</td>', 'the light on the trees makes this image', '2006-11-22 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055086, 430303, 50289, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a better shot to have straightened the horizon.  With the horizon tilting one direction and the fence the other it gives me sence of vertigo.</td>', 'I think it would have been a better shot to have straightened the horizon.  With the horizon tilting one direction and the fence the other it gives me sence of vertigo.', '2006-11-22 15:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055098, 429998, 65779, '<td valign="top">The blown out sky and water worries me a bit</td>', 'The blown out sky and water worries me a bit', '2006-11-22 15:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055103, 429307, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, but just wish the rust texture was more discernible/sharper/more depth/something.  Like the symmetry, although visually, just looks like it needs a nudge up on the left but, not sure.  Perhaps overall, mainly for balance (as well as being able to show off the ''rust'' more), a variation in framing, likely more square, may have given this extra, not sure.  Like your title.  Perspective wise, this is good, but maybe even sharper, especially for this Challenge, with this image, may have also given more impact, who knows.</td>', '7 - Like this, but just wish the rust texture was more discernible/sharper/more depth/something.  Like the symmetry, although visually, just looks like it needs a nudge up on the left but, not sure.  Perhaps overall, mainly for balance (as well as being able to show off the ''rust'' more), a variation in framing, likely more square, may have given this extra, not sure.  Like your title.  Perspective wise, this is good, but maybe even sharper, especially for this Challenge, with this image, may have also given more impact, who knows.', '2006-11-22 15:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055111, 430415, 33352, '<td valign="top">This does not appear to be reality.</td>', 'This does not appear to be reality.', '2006-11-22 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055116, 430415, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Unusual.  Wish it was perfectly square (framewise and symmetrically), but fairly minor.  Difficult, but the fish a little sharper/detailed too, but then you''d likely lose the good and unusual effects on the stones and bubble refracting them.  Unusual color combinations that do work, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Unusual.  Wish it was perfectly square (framewise and symmetrically), but fairly minor.  Difficult, but the fish a little sharper/detailed too, but then you''d likely lose the good and unusual effects on the stones and bubble refracting them.  Unusual color combinations that do work, in my opinion.', '2006-11-22 15:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055119, 429451, 33352, '<td valign="top">Requires better processing.</td>', 'Requires better processing.', '2006-11-22 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055129, 430246, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice image and composition, toning works well.  Perhaps a little more height framewise, not sure.  For this Challenge, would like to have seen a stronger perspective/angle applied here ''somehow''.</td>', '4 - Nice image and composition, toning works well.  Perhaps a little more height framewise, not sure.  For this Challenge, would like to have seen a stronger perspective/angle applied here ''somehow''.', '2006-11-22 15:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055132, 428156, 33352, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of merit, the intriguing part is to capture the light with no sky rotation hoe did you do this....10</td>', 'This has a lot of merit, the intriguing part is to capture the light with no sky rotation hoe did you do this....10', '2006-11-22 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055134, 429529, 65779, '<td valign="top">Great pic but not really perspective.</td>', 'Great pic but not really perspective.', '2006-11-22 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055140, 429415, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice colors, texture and background.  Like to have seen a more unusual perspective/angle deployed for this Challenge with this shot.  Minor, but the oof areas bottom left distract slightly overall in my opinion, perhaps a crop/framing variation to eliminate/minimise it, who knows.</td>', '6 - Nice colors, texture and background.  Like to have seen a more unusual perspective/angle deployed for this Challenge with this shot.  Minor, but the oof areas bottom left distract slightly overall in my opinion, perhaps a crop/framing variation to eliminate/minimise it, who knows.', '2006-11-22 15:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055147, 428156, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice, hope it is ''real''.  Two main factors holding this back for me are the bottom right corner dominates too much and the overall balance/framing - perhaps a variation may have made this even better, not sure.  Difficult, but the beginnings of star trails, either ''more'' or less, may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Also, the sky perhaps, including the color(s), coming through just a <i>little</i> stronger, to give this even more impact/drama.</td>', '7 - Nice, hope it is ''real''.  Two main factors holding this back for me are the bottom right corner dominates too much and the overall balance/framing - perhaps a variation may have made this even better, not sure.  Difficult, but the beginnings of star trails, either ''more'' or less, may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Also, the sky perhaps, including the color(s), coming through just a little stronger, to give this even more impact/drama.', '2006-11-22 15:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055149, 428119, 33352, '<td valign="top">This looks like a scalvert image....8</td>', 'This looks like a scalvert image....8', '2006-11-22 15:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055156, 430197, 50289, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Too bad the power pole can''t be cloned out.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Too bad the power pole can''t be cloned out.', '2006-11-22 15:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055163, 430303, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the potential here.  Wish the horse had more light/was not in the shadows.  Straightening overall as well as a more refined crop, especially to eliminate the road sign on the right, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the potential here.  Wish the horse had more light/was not in the shadows.  Straightening overall as well as a more refined crop, especially to eliminate the road sign on the right, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-11-22 15:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055174, 428359, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Great capture and example of perspective, fish eye ''advantage'' or not.  Toning works well here and I imagine any variation in toning, including sepia/colors, as well as the natural colors, still be a great shot.  Detail is very good.  Really like the angle.  Given both the sloping landscape as well as the position of the mother, I wonder if a slight variation in composition and/or framing (wider?, not sure) may have made this an even better image.<i>edit:typo &amp; congratulations</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-29 00:22:00.</i></td>', '9 - Great capture and example of perspective, fish eye ''advantage'' or not.  Toning works well here and I imagine any variation in toning, including sepia/colors, as well as the natural colors, still be a great shot.  Detail is very good.  Really like the angle.  Given both the sloping landscape as well as the position of the mother, I wonder if a slight variation in composition and/or framing (wider?, not sure) may have made this an even better image.edit:typo & congratulations', '2006-11-22 15:47:24.000000', '2006-11-29 00:22:00.000000', 1),
(3055187, 430456, 68256, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great capture, but the dead center subject with so much negative space makes it uninteresting and it isn''t very sharp.  Good job on the exposure.</td>', 'This would have been a great capture, but the dead center subject with so much negative space makes it uninteresting and it isn''t very sharp.  Good job on the exposure.', '2006-11-22 15:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055192, 429645, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice image.  Variation in the colors, tweaking to try to gain a little more depth, may have given this a little extra in my opinion - although as is, does seem quite natural coloring.  Just the stairs at the fore, their color mainly, perhaps dominate a little too much, not sure.  A slight variation in the lighting/time of day may have also given this a little extra.  Minor, but the exclamation in your title detracts from the simplicity, but you may well have your own reasons for putting it there.  Nice symmetry.</td>', '8 - Nice image.  Variation in the colors, tweaking to try to gain a little more depth, may have given this a little extra in my opinion - although as is, does seem quite natural coloring.  Just the stairs at the fore, their color mainly, perhaps dominate a little too much, not sure.  A slight variation in the lighting/time of day may have also given this a little extra.  Minor, but the exclamation in your title detracts from the simplicity, but you may well have your own reasons for putting it there.  Nice symmetry.', '2006-11-22 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055194, 428939, 68256, '<td valign="top">Strangly interesting, but so dark....it is hard to focus on anything interesting.</td>', 'Strangly interesting, but so dark....it is hard to focus on anything interesting.', '2006-11-22 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3055211, 429816, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m trying my hardest to find perspective in all the perspective IV shots, because there is certainly perspective in every photo.....The little bit of building at a strange angle and a jet stream is hard to interpret though.</td>', 'I''m trying my hardest to find perspective in all the perspective IV shots, because there is certainly perspective in every photo.....The little bit of building at a strange angle and a jet stream is hard to interpret though.', '2006-11-22 15:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
