(3056680, 429808, 7786, '<td valign="top">The compsition is good but it need better processing.<br/>Three things that would make this picture score higher:<br/>1. Its look a little blurry to me. Using unsharp mask or other sharpness tools would help.<br/>2. Use the original fall colors not sepia. <br/>3. Increase brightness of the foreground by using a highlight/shadow tool.</td>', 'The compsition is good but it need better processing.Three things that would make this picture score higher:1. Its look a little blurry to me. Using unsharp mask or other sharpness tools would help.2. Use the original fall colors not sepia. 3. Increase brightness of the foreground by using a highlight/shadow tool.', '2006-11-23 01:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056682, 429815, 7786, '<td valign="top">I think you went too extrem on the HDR, I like the rocks and ocean but the clouds are unrealistic. If you used more than one exposure to make this picture, as is often the case with HDR, its a DQ.</td>', 'I think you went too extrem on the HDR, I like the rocks and ocean but the clouds are unrealistic. If you used more than one exposure to make this picture, as is often the case with HDR, its a DQ.', '2006-11-23 01:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
