(3057917, 430415, 52130, '<td valign="top">very colorful! too bad he was near the glass, but i still really like it and I know how hard it it to photograph fish. good job!</td>', 'very colorful! too bad he was near the glass, but i still really like it and I know how hard it it to photograph fish. good job!', '2006-11-23 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057919, 430342, 52130, '<td valign="top">wow, you really can feel the grandeur of this. A little overexposed on the left, but it''s basic editing, so I''ll let you slide on that one. Great job</td>', 'wow, you really can feel the grandeur of this. A little overexposed on the left, but it''s basic editing, so I''ll let you slide on that one. Great job', '2006-11-23 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057921, 430441, 52130, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...too bad about the tree, although it''s not detrimental to my vote, especially since you put it in the title, good call.</td>', 'beautiful colors...too bad about the tree, although it''s not detrimental to my vote, especially since you put it in the title, good call.', '2006-11-23 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057926, 430363, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the concept.  Wish the focal area was a little wider (or else more to the fore - reducing the focus on the forearm as well) to include the fingers a little more, even if they were still oof, but the fly was more in focus, and more visible.  A <i>slight</i> variation in composition too, perhaps bringing a little more space into the left of frame, not sure.  The b&amp;w works well, as would likely any other toning.  The character/''story'' is good.  A more refined crop as well, especially at bottom.  Good use of perspective.</td>', '6 - Like the concept.  Wish the focal area was a little wider (or else more to the fore - reducing the focus on the forearm as well) to include the fingers a little more, even if they were still oof, but the fly was more in focus, and more visible.  A slight variation in composition too, perhaps bringing a little more space into the left of frame, not sure.  The b&w works well, as would likely any other toning.  The character/''story'' is good.  A more refined crop as well, especially at bottom.  Good use of perspective.', '2006-11-23 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057927, 430270, 52130, '<td valign="top">more contrast! especially when it''s a hazy day</td>', 'more contrast! especially when it''s a hazy day', '2006-11-23 15:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057929, 430221, 52130, '<td valign="top">wonderful, I hink this will place highly</td>', 'wonderful, I hink this will place highly', '2006-11-23 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057931, 430314, 52130, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this. It makes it worthy of the word "Art"</td>', 'I love the composition of this. It makes it worthy of the word "Art"', '2006-11-23 15:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057932, 430479, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the perspective.  Variation in composition and framing, perhaps going for wider or even more of a square framing, likely enhance this subject/''use'' the square lights more, and make it even better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Like the perspective.  Variation in composition and framing, perhaps going for wider or even more of a square framing, likely enhance this subject/''use'' the square lights more, and make it even better in my opinion.', '2006-11-23 15:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057933, 430376, 52130, '<td valign="top">fabulous, although I wish the trees were just a tad darker.</td>', 'fabulous, although I wish the trees were just a tad darker.', '2006-11-23 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057934, 430385, 52130, '<td valign="top">creepy! the flash makes this look unrecognisable and ugly though</td>', 'creepy! the flash makes this look unrecognisable and ugly though', '2006-11-23 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057936, 430455, 52130, '<td valign="top">great blue colors in all the windows as well as good clarity</td>', 'great blue colors in all the windows as well as good clarity', '2006-11-23 15:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057938, 429529, 52130, '<td valign="top">wow, that doesn''t look uncomfortable at ALL, lol. Excellent job working with the shapes of her body, the make-up is also a nice touch</td>', 'wow, that doesn''t look uncomfortable at ALL, lol. Excellent job working with the shapes of her body, the make-up is also a nice touch', '2006-11-23 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057948, 430337, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Toning works very well here, adding good depth/drama.  Might be a shot that cannot be appreciated at this size and the resizing has caused aspects like the (seemingly) ''overexposure'' to be accentuated.  Maybe an even squarer framing/crop, who knows, else a more refined crop, mainly to eliminate the white ''something'' near bottom left corner.  Likewise, undedided if I would prefer to see more of the ''different'' building coming into frame on the left, else it cropped out altogether and the chimera/''gargoyle'' featuring more prominently.  Excellent perspective.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Toning works very well here, adding good depth/drama.  Might be a shot that cannot be appreciated at this size and the resizing has caused aspects like the (seemingly) ''overexposure'' to be accentuated.  Maybe an even squarer framing/crop, who knows, else a more refined crop, mainly to eliminate the white ''something'' near bottom left corner.  Likewise, undedided if I would prefer to see more of the ''different'' building coming into frame on the left, else it cropped out altogether and the chimera/''gargoyle'' featuring more prominently.  Excellent perspective.', '2006-11-23 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057951, 430281, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the colors and scene.  A more refined crop, especially left and right, some ''tweaking'' in pp to gain a little more depth/drama, as well as the ''posts'' in just a little more focus make this even better in my opinion.  Like the reflections in the puddles - if they were featured more ''somehow'', likely give this even more of an edge.</td>', '6 - Like the colors and scene.  A more refined crop, especially left and right, some ''tweaking'' in pp to gain a little more depth/drama, as well as the ''posts'' in just a little more focus make this even better in my opinion.  Like the reflections in the puddles - if they were featured more ''somehow'', likely give this even more of an edge.', '2006-11-23 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057952, 429816, 63884, '<td valign="top">not that interesting</td>', 'not that interesting', '2006-11-23 15:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057953, 428904, 63884, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-11-23 15:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057971, 428142, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good and unusual.  Wish it was a little sharper, especially around the mouth.  A more refined crop at the bottom.  Like the ''catchlight'' and oof effect of the eye.</td>', '8 - Good and unusual.  Wish it was a little sharper, especially around the mouth.  A more refined crop at the bottom.  Like the ''catchlight'' and oof effect of the eye.', '2006-11-23 15:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
