(3058001, 428912, 55956, '<td valign="top">good the perspective and the colours, the light is good and even the composition is nice. the only small problem is the first chandelier(on the left) that is too hidden (dark).</td>', 'good the perspective and the colours, the light is good and even the composition is nice. the only small problem is the first chandelier(on the left) that is too hidden (dark).', '2006-11-23 16:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
