(3058236, 430262, 60698, '<td valign="top">I am such a sucker for animals and dogs have such expressive eyes. The technicals of this shot are great but what sets it apart are the eyes on this adorable dog. Wonderful!!</td>', 'I am such a sucker for animals and dogs have such expressive eyes. The technicals of this shot are great but what sets it apart are the eyes on this adorable dog. Wonderful!!', '2006-11-23 20:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
