(3058285, 429936, 63503, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2006-11-23 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058287, 429415, 68504, '<td valign="top">Not bad:  good colour and background and even a little drama in the shifting directions of the pointy chevron things.</td>', 'Not bad:  good colour and background and even a little drama in the shifting directions of the pointy chevron things.', '2006-11-23 20:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058289, 429907, 68504, '<td valign="top">Well done.  (Fridge camera beats fridge magnets).</td>', 'Well done.  (Fridge camera beats fridge magnets).', '2006-11-23 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058295, 429559, 68504, '<td valign="top">I dunno.  I take this kind of picture a lot.  Why doesn"t it work for me?  It could be the reduced resolution in your picture, but I"m thinking the sky and its reflection have a whole theme of their own, and the grass silhouettes interfere - maybe too many of them. The lights and darks are very good.</td>', 'I dunno.  I take this kind of picture a lot.  Why doesn"t it work for me?  It could be the reduced resolution in your picture, but I"m thinking the sky and its reflection have a whole theme of their own, and the grass silhouettes interfere - maybe too many of them. The lights and darks are very good.', '2006-11-23 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058302, 430440, 68504, '<td valign="top">Stunning light and colour.</td>', 'Stunning light and colour.', '2006-11-23 20:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058313, 428196, 68504, '<td valign="top">Would really like to see this uncompressed!</td>', 'Would really like to see this uncompressed!', '2006-11-23 20:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058338, 430472, 68504, '<td valign="top">Good to look at.</td>', 'Good to look at.', '2006-11-23 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058343, 430166, 65498, '<td valign="top">too good... beautiful!!</td>', 'too good... beautiful!!', '2006-11-23 21:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058345, 430472, 65498, '<td valign="top">wonderful.. a common perspective though</td>', 'wonderful.. a common perspective though', '2006-11-23 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058380, 430435, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great use of the yellow lines, though I keep wanting to recrop the picture.</td>', 'Great use of the yellow lines, though I keep wanting to recrop the picture.', '2006-11-23 21:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058383, 429838, 68504, '<td valign="top">Nice dissposition of leavess.</td>', 'Nice dissposition of leavess.', '2006-11-23 21:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058435, 430432, 67145, '<td valign="top">different, unusual and interesting ... and i cant quite make out wots going on ... which isnt unusual ...</td>', 'different, unusual and interesting ... and i cant quite make out wots going on ... which isnt unusual ...', '2006-11-23 22:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058437, 430422, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is definitely a stunner ........ the blue of the sky, and the blue on the buildings ... the juxtaposition of the ''statues''?... makes for an extremely interesting shot .......... =8</td>', 'this is definitely a stunner ........ the blue of the sky, and the blue on the buildings ... the juxtaposition of the ''statues''?... makes for an extremely interesting shot .......... =8', '2006-11-23 22:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058443, 429644, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is a real interesting and quite unusual shot ...  the thin poles make a good contrast to the fairly dramatic cloud formation ... also the gritty look in the foreground contrasts well with the coulds  ... the city between makes a good division ... i especially like the way the ''wind socks''? are nearly horizontal .... i reckon the perspective is more in the clouds than the poles, but wotever ... =8</td>', 'this is a real interesting and quite unusual shot ...  the thin poles make a good contrast to the fairly dramatic cloud formation ... also the gritty look in the foreground contrasts well with the coulds  ... the city between makes a good division ... i especially like the way the ''wind socks''? are nearly horizontal .... i reckon the perspective is more in the clouds than the poles, but wotever ... =8', '2006-11-23 22:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058446, 430299, 67145, '<td valign="top">not meaning to be rude or anything ... but where''s the perspective? ... it could actually be there quite obviously and i''ve missed it .....</td>', 'not meaning to be rude or anything ... but where''s the perspective? ... it could actually be there quite obviously and i''ve missed it .....', '2006-11-23 22:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058448, 430481, 67145, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective .. it certainly draws you right into the photo ..</td>', 'interesting perspective .. it certainly draws you right into the photo ..', '2006-11-23 22:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058455, 428873, 67145, '<td valign="top">very dramatic .... and i love the contrast between the darkened building and the lights above, and the way they fade out as you move up the building and it goes dark again ..... and then the bit of light at the top to balance it out..... =8</td>', 'very dramatic .... and i love the contrast between the darkened building and the lights above, and the way they fade out as you move up the building and it goes dark again ..... and then the bit of light at the top to balance it out..... =8', '2006-11-23 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058467, 430468, 67145, '<td valign="top">far out, wot an interesting shot ... i''m wondering just how you did it? .. coz i dont think they''re different people with all the same clothes! .. which means its all one person .. would like to do a bit with long exposure myself, but at the moment i''ve got no idea ..... anyway ...... this is not only clever and well thought out ... but extremely visually pleasing as well ....... =8</td>', 'far out, wot an interesting shot ... i''m wondering just how you did it? .. coz i dont think they''re different people with all the same clothes! .. which means its all one person .. would like to do a bit with long exposure myself, but at the moment i''ve got no idea ..... anyway ...... this is not only clever and well thought out ... but extremely visually pleasing as well ....... =8', '2006-11-23 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058481, 428959, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is definitely a wow .... i just love the contrast in ''textures'' between the wet pavement below and the wire meshy stuff above, which has a very trippy feel to it as it fades into the distance and the gaps become smaller and smaller .. =9</td>', 'this is definitely a wow .... i just love the contrast in ''textures'' between the wet pavement below and the wire meshy stuff above, which has a very trippy feel to it as it fades into the distance and the gaps become smaller and smaller .. =9', '2006-11-23 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058501, 429040, 67145, '<td valign="top">wow ... far out .... this is definitely a winner to me .... i couldnt quite make out wot it was at first, and then the stairs became obvious and it all fell into place .. i love the not immediately obvious, i love the slanted feel, i love the rich colours and the contrasts between the red/orange hues and blue, i love the shine on the pavement and i love the rich blue of the sky .. i could go on, coz there''s heaps more that i love about this photo, but i do have a life! ... =10</td>', 'wow ... far out .... this is definitely a winner to me .... i couldnt quite make out wot it was at first, and then the stairs became obvious and it all fell into place .. i love the not immediately obvious, i love the slanted feel, i love the rich colours and the contrasts between the red/orange hues and blue, i love the shine on the pavement and i love the rich blue of the sky .. i could go on, coz there''s heaps more that i love about this photo, but i do have a life! ... =10', '2006-11-23 23:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
