(3058559, 429907, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good execution. The post processing or lack there of holds this back a bit, IMO. I''d suggest sharpening it some more as well as boosting the overal contrast and local contast. I''d also suggest dodging and burning a bit particularly the edges which are already vignette-like. That would help drive the focus more towards the guy''s face. Anyway, just thoughts. Good luck!</td>', 'Great idea and good execution. The post processing or lack there of holds this back a bit, IMO. I''d suggest sharpening it some more as well as boosting the overal contrast and local contast. I''d also suggest dodging and burning a bit particularly the edges which are already vignette-like. That would help drive the focus more towards the guy''s face. Anyway, just thoughts. Good luck!', '2006-11-23 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058560, 429040, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is composed really well. Everything just fits well within the frame. The image is also sharp, clear and has good color. I think you did a great job with this subject. Good luck!</td>', 'This is composed really well. Everything just fits well within the frame. The image is also sharp, clear and has good color. I think you did a great job with this subject. Good luck!', '2006-11-23 23:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
