(3060103, 430270, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept.  Potential for one of those ''motivational'' posters.  Image looks like it needs a rotate up on the left, but depends what you had to work with.  The gentleman more in frame and the pose a little more ''confident'' (not easy).  Undecided, but possibly more of a square framing, for balance, or else just a variation on the composition, may give this extra and make it even better in my opinion.  For this Challenge, looks like the potential may be there for an even stronger/more unusual perspective (camera-wise) for this type of image/location/etc, (rather than ''distance/vista'' perspective) if that makes sense.</td>', '4 - Like the concept.  Potential for one of those ''motivational'' posters.  Image looks like it needs a rotate up on the left, but depends what you had to work with.  The gentleman more in frame and the pose a little more ''confident'' (not easy).  Undecided, but possibly more of a square framing, for balance, or else just a variation on the composition, may give this extra and make it even better in my opinion.  For this Challenge, looks like the potential may be there for an even stronger/more unusual perspective (camera-wise) for this type of image/location/etc, (rather than ''distance/vista'' perspective) if that makes sense.', '2006-11-24 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060107, 429962, 5728, '<td valign="top">Like this, super perspective!</td>', 'Like this, super perspective!', '2006-11-24 16:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060125, 429815, 5728, '<td valign="top">Definitely overprocessed for sure but this seems to work well in DPC lately, so it will do well I bet.</td>', 'Definitely overprocessed for sure but this seems to work well in DPC lately, so it will do well I bet.', '2006-11-24 17:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060127, 429144, 5728, '<td valign="top">Antarctica? Cool shot, this will do well!</td>', 'Antarctica? Cool shot, this will do well!', '2006-11-24 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060131, 428359, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent (10)</td>', 'Excellent (10)', '2006-11-24 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060154, 428448, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice image.  The obvious overexposure on the paw(s) aside, the b&amp;w works well here.  Just the background elements detract overall, but fairly minor.  Like the ground level perspective.  Softness works, undecided if sharper would make this even better, likely just a ''different'' type of shot.  Depending what you had to work with, a nudge rotate up on the left (without cropping out ears/paws) and 640, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Undecided on the dark outer frame.</td>', '6 - Nice image.  The obvious overexposure on the paw(s) aside, the b&w works well here.  Just the background elements detract overall, but fairly minor.  Like the ground level perspective.  Softness works, undecided if sharper would make this even better, likely just a ''different'' type of shot.  Depending what you had to work with, a nudge rotate up on the left (without cropping out ears/paws) and 640, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Undecided on the dark outer frame.', '2006-11-24 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060176, 429544, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice image and perspective.  Like the angle and use of the wide angle lens.  Like the effect of the leaves at the bottom/fore, almost has a ''sweeping'' effect.  Colors are very nice.  Mainly the top right corner, a more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe on the left too where the tree is, but minor.</td>', '8 - Nice image and perspective.  Like the angle and use of the wide angle lens.  Like the effect of the leaves at the bottom/fore, almost has a ''sweeping'' effect.  Colors are very nice.  Mainly the top right corner, a more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe on the left too where the tree is, but minor.', '2006-11-24 17:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060181, 430376, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice image.  Wish it was 640.  Toning works well.</td>', '6 - Nice image.  Wish it was 640.  Toning works well.', '2006-11-24 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060204, 428565, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow.  Very nice color.  Perhaps the darker color blue/purple underneath dominates a little too much, but then it does offset and complement the darker colors in the gecko.  The use of the very shallow dof works really wellhere, not just with the eye and textures, but the leaf(?) and colors as well.  Wish it were bigger ''somehow'', but I realise it is already 640 width.  Maybe a bit more green above (if you had it obviously), just for extra ''size'', might change the image too much so, who knows.  Good perspective.  Nice shot.  A frame would likely bring this to life even more, but pixels are precious, especially with an image like this, in this medium.  Nice and clean, really can''t see any grain at all.  If this was neat imaged, it still works well in my opinion, without a little more discernible texture, which would also have likely made this even better.  Basic editing Challenge though so, fairly limited.</td>', '9 - Wow.  Very nice color.  Perhaps the darker color blue/purple underneath dominates a little too much, but then it does offset and complement the darker colors in the gecko.  The use of the very shallow dof works really wellhere, not just with the eye and textures, but the leaf(?) and colors as well.  Wish it were bigger ''somehow'', but I realise it is already 640 width.  Maybe a bit more green above (if you had it obviously), just for extra ''size'', might change the image too much so, who knows.  Good perspective.  Nice shot.  A frame would likely bring this to life even more, but pixels are precious, especially with an image like this, in this medium.  Nice and clean, really can''t see any grain at all.  If this was neat imaged, it still works well in my opinion, without a little more discernible texture, which would also have likely made this even better.  Basic editing Challenge though so, fairly limited.', '2006-11-24 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060211, 429567, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome and should be on the front page when the results come out.....</td>', 'This is just awesome and should be on the front page when the results come out.....', '2006-11-24 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
