(3060419, 428367, 65107, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the point of the challenge, that is to use perpective, a sense of depth, distance and the relationship of objects near and far, to create a sense of drama.  This photo is more of a two-dimensional abstract.</td>', 'I think you missed the point of the challenge, that is to use perpective, a sense of depth, distance and the relationship of objects near and far, to create a sense of drama.  This photo is more of a two-dimensional abstract.', '2006-11-24 21:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
