(3060446, 428912, 65107, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  This illustrates a problem with perspecitve.  The walls are leaning in.  This is true persective, but it appears as distortion, and distracts from the appreciatioin of this amazing room.  For the walls to be vertical the camera need to be level or a special lens is required.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  This illustrates a problem with perspecitve.  The walls are leaning in.  This is true persective, but it appears as distortion, and distracts from the appreciatioin of this amazing room.  For the walls to be vertical the camera need to be level or a special lens is required.', '2006-11-24 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060483, 429529, 2389, '<td valign="top">I like the almost perfect symmetry - and nice perspective too...</td>', 'I like the almost perfect symmetry - and nice perspective too...', '2006-11-24 22:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
