(3060691, 430262, 18367, '<td valign="top">The facial expression on this dog is absolutely priceless.  Great focus and DOF.  Hope  this does well in the challenge, as it is a really good capture.  An 8 for now, but I will be back.</td>', 'The facial expression on this dog is absolutely priceless.  Great focus and DOF.  Hope  this does well in the challenge, as it is a really good capture.  An 8 for now, but I will be back.', '2006-11-24 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
