(3060953, 430144, 67324, '<td valign="top">This is a bit plain. Maybe a futher from the tree as to make it longer and thinner in the frame. A nice cloudy day. And a selective desat on the red channel to make the blue more dramatic. But if you like it as it is, who really cares what I say :P</td>', 'This is a bit plain. Maybe a futher from the tree as to make it longer and thinner in the frame. A nice cloudy day. And a selective desat on the red channel to make the blue more dramatic. But if you like it as it is, who really cares what I say :P', '2006-11-25 04:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
