(3061101, 428912, 68769, '<td valign="top">Good color, not a shot to look at for just a second, lots going on. The focus seems a little soft, but at this depth something will seem soft. Although fairly level (I checked) the brighter light on the left pulls the eye making the right seem heavy, but that might add to the Perspective in itself. All in all I like it.</td>', 'Good color, not a shot to look at for just a second, lots going on. The focus seems a little soft, but at this depth something will seem soft. Although fairly level (I checked) the brighter light on the left pulls the eye making the right seem heavy, but that might add to the Perspective in itself. All in all I like it.', '2006-11-25 08:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061112, 429369, 68769, '<td valign="top">Out at night making other drivers nervous, LOL, I see how they are changing lanes. Big fan of this shot, no. Fit into challenge, yes. High medium score.</td>', 'Out at night making other drivers nervous, LOL, I see how they are changing lanes. Big fan of this shot, no. Fit into challenge, yes. High medium score.', '2006-11-25 08:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
