(3061658, 429807, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I think you wanted to include the snake''s shadow, I don''t think it really enhances this shot. The composition might be stronger with more space below his head.</td>', 'Although I think you wanted to include the snake''s shadow, I don''t think it really enhances this shot. The composition might be stronger with more space below his head.', '2006-11-25 16:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
