(3062282, 429528, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see you bump up the red hue in this to bring out the brick more. On a side note I noticed too is that if you turn the reds all the way down the painting of the guy in the top center window stands out more which is pretty cool.</td>', 'I would have liked to see you bump up the red hue in this to bring out the brick more. On a side note I noticed too is that if you turn the reds all the way down the painting of the guy in the top center window stands out more which is pretty cool.', '2006-11-25 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062289, 429058, 60173, '<td valign="top">It looks like the contrast was bumped up too high, but that doesn''t make me not like the photo entirely. It kinda looks cartoonish. That could be very good in certain situations. This is one to think about.</td>', 'It looks like the contrast was bumped up too high, but that doesn''t make me not like the photo entirely. It kinda looks cartoonish. That could be very good in certain situations. This is one to think about.', '2006-11-25 23:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
