(3065320, 428509, 67006, '<td valign="top">The rough border between B&amp;W in foreground is really distracting from an otherwise cool photo.</td>', 'The rough border between B&W in foreground is really distracting from an otherwise cool photo.', '2006-11-27 08:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065429, 429529, 64594, '<td valign="top">The photo is good, the model is amazing! :-)</td>', 'The photo is good, the model is amazing! :-)', '2006-11-27 09:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065449, 430125, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, clean, interestng perspective.  If there would have been any way to get more of the top to show the light that would have been great.  I''m sure though with this strong perspective that would have been tough.</td>', 'Nice shot, clean, interestng perspective.  If there would have been any way to get more of the top to show the light that would have been great.  I''m sure though with this strong perspective that would have been tough.', '2006-11-27 09:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065490, 429728, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice one</td>', 'nice one', '2006-11-27 10:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065503, 428356, 64594, '<td valign="top">I see nothing that stands out about this photo at all.  Even the perspective is the exact same perspective that we all have of cranes.</td>', 'I see nothing that stands out about this photo at all.  Even the perspective is the exact same perspective that we all have of cranes.', '2006-11-27 10:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065770, 430469, 30949, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ve taken about ten photos like this one, but I still like it.  Philly whoo!  This building lends itself to so many great abstract photographs.</td>', 'Okay, I''ve taken about ten photos like this one, but I still like it.  Philly whoo!  This building lends itself to so many great abstract photographs.', '2006-11-27 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065777, 429878, 30949, '<td valign="top">I get what you were going for, but the photo could have been better set-up.  Move the camera a few inches tot he right to get everything perfectly symmetrical.  The center bar over top of the bridge should cut straight down the middle of the photograph.  Then play with the levels, S-curves, bump up the saturation a little... add some sharpening.  There are things that can be done to make the resulting image more interesting.</td>', 'I get what you were going for, but the photo could have been better set-up.  Move the camera a few inches tot he right to get everything perfectly symmetrical.  The center bar over top of the bridge should cut straight down the middle of the photograph.  Then play with the levels, S-curves, bump up the saturation a little... add some sharpening.  There are things that can be done to make the resulting image more interesting.', '2006-11-27 12:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065918, 429709, 32644, '<td valign="top">YIKES!!</td>', 'YIKES!!', '2006-11-27 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065930, 430383, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very good, great perspective.</td>', 'Very good, great perspective.', '2006-11-27 13:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065932, 429144, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing shot.</td>', 'Wow! Amazing shot.', '2006-11-27 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065934, 428924, 52549, '<td valign="top">Definitely an interesting perspective.</td>', 'Definitely an interesting perspective.', '2006-11-27 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065935, 428663, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I could imagine this looking great in b/w.</td>', 'Very nice, I could imagine this looking great in b/w.', '2006-11-27 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065938, 428631, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very cool - love the colours.</td>', 'Very cool - love the colours.', '2006-11-27 13:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065941, 429390, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful - this reminds me of Larus''s work. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Very beautiful - this reminds me of Larus''s work. Good luck with it.', '2006-11-27 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066001, 430262, 17990, '<td valign="top">Owww... That face! This is a great pet picture! I loved it! (so much I`m gonna make it a fav) Then only thing that can bother me a little is the crop on the left leg, everything else is great! 9...</td>', 'Owww... That face! This is a great pet picture! I loved it! (so much I`m gonna make it a fav) Then only thing that can bother me a little is the crop on the left leg, everything else is great! 9...', '2006-11-27 14:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066022, 429067, 36850, '<td valign="top">Where was the picture taken?</td>', 'Where was the picture taken?', '2006-11-27 14:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066149, 430245, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure where to look in this shot. The foreground boats don''t form much of a line but point to the sandbar which leads my eyes off to the right toward ... nothing at all. The background boats also lead nowhere. The contrast of the colors in front with the drab everything else is interesting. Perhaps a different angle or perspective would help give the overall shot some focus and/or heft.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure where to look in this shot. The foreground boats don''t form much of a line but point to the sandbar which leads my eyes off to the right toward ... nothing at all. The background boats also lead nowhere. The contrast of the colors in front with the drab everything else is interesting. Perhaps a different angle or perspective would help give the overall shot some focus and/or heft.', '2006-11-27 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066165, 429127, 208, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, but I wish they lead to something other than a plastic bag stuck in a tree. I do like the ominous feel of the black &amp; white - a not-so-nice reminder of how daunting a playground can be when you''re so small.</td>', 'Great leading lines, but I wish they lead to something other than a plastic bag stuck in a tree. I do like the ominous feel of the black & white - a not-so-nice reminder of how daunting a playground can be when you''re so small.', '2006-11-27 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066171, 429690, 208, '<td valign="top">I really like how clean this is. The boat stands out nicely from the water without being oversharp. I even like the title and the border.</td>', 'I really like how clean this is. The boat stands out nicely from the water without being oversharp. I even like the title and the border.', '2006-11-27 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066180, 428189, 208, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Love the soft focus on the figure and how the umbrella stands out from the white on the building. There''s a great feeling of movement with her foot picked up.</td>', 'Great capture! Love the soft focus on the figure and how the umbrella stands out from the white on the building. There''s a great feeling of movement with her foot picked up.', '2006-11-27 15:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066188, 429979, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I like the circle within the triangle with squares &amp; rectangles on the outside. Now if you could just move your left pantleg a wee little bit....</td>', 'Cool idea. I like the circle within the triangle with squares & rectangles on the outside. Now if you could just move your left pantleg a wee little bit....', '2006-11-27 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066220, 428359, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I love it. Very artsy.</td>', 'Fantastic, I love it. Very artsy.', '2006-11-27 15:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
