(3066944, 430337, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous toning. I love the high contrast but smooth and clean feel to the image. Great compoosition, the way the buildings draw the eye into the frame makes the image very dynamic, and the round building at the bottom left is the key to a great image since it has very varied (hehe) surfaces, shapes and textures, and I think ends up being the most interesting part of the photo. Great image, can''t think of anything I don''t like about it.</td>', 'Fabulous toning. I love the high contrast but smooth and clean feel to the image. Great compoosition, the way the buildings draw the eye into the frame makes the image very dynamic, and the round building at the bottom left is the key to a great image since it has very varied (hehe) surfaces, shapes and textures, and I think ends up being the most interesting part of the photo. Great image, can''t think of anything I don''t like about it.', '2006-11-27 20:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066947, 429567, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very clean, very precise. I like it, but what is it?</td>', 'Very clean, very precise. I like it, but what is it?', '2006-11-27 20:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
