(3068223, 430402, 67006, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit silly of me, and I AM new to DPC, but I''d like to see her toes, perhaps with red polish to highlight the red of the chair.  This''d elongate the line of her lovely shape.  Otherwise the pose, perspective idea is brilliant.</td>', 'Maybe a bit silly of me, and I AM new to DPC, but I''d like to see her toes, perhaps with red polish to highlight the red of the chair.  This''d elongate the line of her lovely shape.  Otherwise the pose, perspective idea is brilliant.', '2006-11-28 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
