(3069011, 430402, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very lush color and certainly an interesting perspective.  I like the harsh feel of the processing and the softness of the dress &amp; model...it''s a good contrast.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very lush color and certainly an interesting perspective.  I like the harsh feel of the processing and the softness of the dress & model...it''s a good contrast.  Good luck.', '2006-11-28 19:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069014, 429994, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think you''re a bit too close to the rail, and the out of focus parts are distracting to me.  The man in the distance is a small part of the shot...almost lost.  Train tracks are an interesting subject thanks the built in leading lines, but I think that this shot could be more successful if you revisit it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think you''re a bit too close to the rail, and the out of focus parts are distracting to me.  The man in the distance is a small part of the shot...almost lost.  Train tracks are an interesting subject thanks the built in leading lines, but I think that this shot could be more successful if you revisit it.  Good luck.', '2006-11-28 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069026, 429078, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective and strong graphical elements.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective and strong graphical elements.  Good luck this week.', '2006-11-28 19:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
