(3069317, 430166, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really awesome photo! The contrast of the people''s size with the more distant lighthouse is really interesting. The sky is perfect, everything in the image is tack-sharp and crisp. A very clean composition, no distractions to dampen the impact it has.</td>', 'Really awesome photo! The contrast of the people''s size with the more distant lighthouse is really interesting. The sky is perfect, everything in the image is tack-sharp and crisp. A very clean composition, no distractions to dampen the impact it has.', '2006-11-28 21:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
