(3070139, 428662, 64176, '<td valign="top">This photo is fabulous.  IMO, should have been in the top 10.  Beautiful perspective, amazing color and contrast.  I would love to have this on my bedroom wall.  It''s one of my favorites on the site.  It''s dramatic and relaxing at the same time.  LOVE IT! (I gave it a 9)</td>', 'This photo is fabulous.  IMO, should have been in the top 10.  Beautiful perspective, amazing color and contrast.  I would love to have this on my bedroom wall.  It''s one of my favorites on the site.  It''s dramatic and relaxing at the same time.  LOVE IT! (I gave it a 9)', '2006-11-29 00:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
