(3070656, 429925, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh dear.  I''m beginning to think I need professional help.  I''m starting to think like you in some weird and abnormal fashion.  I liked this.  I liked the perspective, yes, but mostly I liked the feel of it.  Real, a little lonely but not too, and everyday.  Ain''t nothing wrong with the florescents - that''s the way they are - bright, washed out looking.  I think you captured them quite well actually.</td>', 'Oh dear.  I''m beginning to think I need professional help.  I''m starting to think like you in some weird and abnormal fashion.  I liked this.  I liked the perspective, yes, but mostly I liked the feel of it.  Real, a little lonely but not too, and everyday.  Ain''t nothing wrong with the florescents - that''s the way they are - bright, washed out looking.  I think you captured them quite well actually.', '2006-11-29 03:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
