(3070734, 429816, 19333, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thanks everyone who voted and commented.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kelbelle:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved this and gave it an 8.  I love the simplicity, the way the white line stops where it does, the angle, the flow, the clarity and the minimalism.  Well done.  I''m surprised more people don''t see the beauty here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot! I love it too, it seems we''re all alone here... ;-)</td>', 'Thanks everyone who voted and commented. Originally posted by kelbelle: I loved this and gave it an 8.  I love the simplicity, the way the white line stops where it does, the angle, the flow, the clarity and the minimalism.  Well done.  I''m surprised more people don''t see the beauty here.   Thanks a lot! I love it too, it seems we''re all alone here... ;-)', '2006-11-29 04:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
