(3071086, 429567, 15358, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all with the many positive comments.  I was very happy with this image.  The image is of a latticed dome over a courtyard.  The top is probably 30 plus feet above the ground.  With out a wide angle lense I couldn''t capture the curve of the dome.   Enjoy.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-29 07:56:52.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all with the many positive comments.  I was very happy with this image.  The image is of a latticed dome over a courtyard.  The top is probably 30 plus feet above the ground.  With out a wide angle lense I couldn''t capture the curve of the dome.   Enjoy.', '2006-11-29 07:56:08.000000', '2006-11-29 07:56:52.000000', 0),
