(3071306, 429152, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yuck!  That''s for the bird guts part, not the picture.  I actually do like the picture.  I take the perspective part as not your perspective looking up at the bird, but the bird looking down at you.  Kinda like "Hey, I''m eating here.  Do you mind?"  Really good clarity for a big crop.  I like the stray feathers over on the one side.  Poor other bird...</td>', 'Yuck!  That''s for the bird guts part, not the picture.  I actually do like the picture.  I take the perspective part as not your perspective looking up at the bird, but the bird looking down at you.  Kinda like "Hey, I''m eating here.  Do you mind?"  Really good clarity for a big crop.  I like the stray feathers over on the one side.  Poor other bird...', '2006-11-29 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071314, 430196, 11854, '<td valign="top">Top 20! WooHoo! This is an excellent shot, I''m puzzled you didn''t get more comments. Especially with that high a score. I''d put it down to less people commenting in general. And as someone else pointed out, this is a "Deb" shot!</td>', 'Top 20! WooHoo! This is an excellent shot, I''m puzzled you didn''t get more comments. Especially with that high a score. I''d put it down to less people commenting in general. And as someone else pointed out, this is a "Deb" shot!', '2006-11-29 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071334, 430320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - you almost got my ribbon for no comments during a challenge.  True sign of a suck team member!  I thought this met the challenge but it didn''t quite speak to me.  The parts I like best are the barbed wire and the clouds, yet those elements aren''t what contributes to what I see as the "perspective".  The part I''m not quite sure about is overall, the eye kinda just wanders with no specific place to go.  That''s not necessarily a bad thing, but in a perspective shot (as I understand them) you do want to try to lead the eye a bit.  The upward curve of the support thingie (I lack the terminology) does lead to the sky, but too far on the right of the picture to give you "room", and the rest seems to counteract that leading line.  Is any of this making any sense?</td>', 'Wow - you almost got my ribbon for no comments during a challenge.  True sign of a suck team member!  I thought this met the challenge but it didn''t quite speak to me.  The parts I like best are the barbed wire and the clouds, yet those elements aren''t what contributes to what I see as the "perspective".  The part I''m not quite sure about is overall, the eye kinda just wanders with no specific place to go.  That''s not necessarily a bad thing, but in a perspective shot (as I understand them) you do want to try to lead the eye a bit.  The upward curve of the support thingie (I lack the terminology) does lead to the sky, but too far on the right of the picture to give you "room", and the rest seems to counteract that leading line.  Is any of this making any sense?', '2006-11-29 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071349, 430240, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Love the DNMC comment.  I''m of the camp that it does indeed meet the challenge.  The lighting is good on this and the contrast/clash in colors adds a kick.  The part I find interesting for some reason is the writing on the one jack and not the others.  In a way that''s part of a personal perspective - in my day jacks were metal, not plastic, and REALLY hurt when you stepped on them.</td>', 'Heh!  Love the DNMC comment.  I''m of the camp that it does indeed meet the challenge.  The lighting is good on this and the contrast/clash in colors adds a kick.  The part I find interesting for some reason is the writing on the one jack and not the others.  In a way that''s part of a personal perspective - in my day jacks were metal, not plastic, and REALLY hurt when you stepped on them.', '2006-11-29 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071356, 430481, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, woman.  This doesn''t exactly suck, now does it?  Nice score, nice placement!  I''ve never seen this bridge in person, but it certainly does make for a lovely subject for photography.  The thing I found different with this shot is the pink.  Pink is not something I would associate with the Brooklyn Bridge.  Dull brown and gray, possibly some dusty shade of green, but not pink.  Well seen, well shot, and nicely processed.</td>', 'Dang, woman.  This doesn''t exactly suck, now does it?  Nice score, nice placement!  I''ve never seen this bridge in person, but it certainly does make for a lovely subject for photography.  The thing I found different with this shot is the pink.  Pink is not something I would associate with the Brooklyn Bridge.  Dull brown and gray, possibly some dusty shade of green, but not pink.  Well seen, well shot, and nicely processed.', '2006-11-29 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071363, 429815, 24454, '<td valign="top">I thought either Iceland or you :)  Another "not to be believed" beautifully shot and processed photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I thought either Iceland or you :)  Another "not to be believed" beautifully shot and processed photo! ', '2006-11-29 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071365, 430316, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dude!  A 6!  Woo hoo!  I do so like shots like these.  Kinda sterile sometimes but this one seems to have life in it.  In addition to the cool blues/grays of the glass/steel, you''ve got the warmth of the orange from the lights.  OK, you do architecture well - now branch out and try, umm, different architecture?  :-)</td>', 'Dude!  A 6!  Woo hoo!  I do so like shots like these.  Kinda sterile sometimes but this one seems to have life in it.  In addition to the cool blues/grays of the glass/steel, you''ve got the warmth of the orange from the lights.  OK, you do architecture well - now branch out and try, umm, different architecture?  :-)', '2006-11-29 09:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071367, 430469, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is just so amazing!  I have tried in our botanical garden to get photos like this inside our greenhouses so I appreciate what a fantastic job you did showing the detail in the structure against the bright sky -- and in basic editing too!  EXCELLENT photography!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is just so amazing!  I have tried in our botanical garden to get photos like this inside our greenhouses so I appreciate what a fantastic job you did showing the detail in the structure against the bright sky -- and in basic editing too!  EXCELLENT photography! ', '2006-11-29 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071370, 428142, 59564, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most interesting perspectives in the challenge.  I think you should have placed higher.</td>', 'This is one of the most interesting perspectives in the challenge.  I think you should have placed higher.', '2006-11-29 09:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071377, 428662, 554, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.....that is the dramatic effect*****</td>', 'Breathtaking.....that is the dramatic effect*****', '2006-11-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071378, 428649, 24454, '<td valign="top">How cool is THAT. . .to download your photo, take a look at it and go, "This is perfect" with no editing!  And you certainly were right.  It needs nothing and is flawless!!  One of my favorites of all time!</td>', 'How cool is THAT. . .to download your photo, take a look at it and go, "This is perfect" with no editing!  And you certainly were right.  It needs nothing and is flawless!!  One of my favorites of all time!', '2006-11-29 09:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071380, 429925, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the way you got low for this shot, accentuating the height of the shelves. A daunting task for the stock boy, who''s not much of a boy anymore.</td>', 'I like the way you got low for this shot, accentuating the height of the shelves. A daunting task for the stock boy, who''s not much of a boy anymore.', '2006-11-29 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071382, 430349, 24454, '<td valign="top">Charmayne, this is so striking and appealing!   Congratulations on another top finisher!  You''re awesome :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Charmayne, this is so striking and appealing!   Congratulations on another top finisher!  You''re awesome :) ', '2006-11-29 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071389, 430342, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Just goes to show:  ANY angle of these stunning architectural wonders is worthy of top honors!   Congratulations on a very well done photo and such a strong finish.</td>', 'Wow!  Just goes to show:  ANY angle of these stunning architectural wonders is worthy of top honors!   Congratulations on a very well done photo and such a strong finish.', '2006-11-29 10:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071390, 429728, 554, '<td valign="top">amazing capture****</td>', 'amazing capture****', '2006-11-29 10:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071393, 430476, 24454, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. . .this is SO CUTE!  Should be some kind of irreverant poster or something :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Tee hee. . .this is SO CUTE!  Should be some kind of irreverant poster or something :) ', '2006-11-29 10:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071398, 430240, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s the upward curve in the back that I find interesting.</td>', 'It''s the upward curve in the back that I find interesting.', '2006-11-29 10:03:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071399, 430293, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I wonder why this wasn''t on the 1st page!  Stunning photo<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  I wonder why this wasn''t on the 1st page!  Stunning photo ', '2006-11-29 10:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071418, 429979, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww. . .so underrated!  Why didn''t everyone else see this as an 8 score like I did :(   Great job!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awww. . .so underrated!  Why didn''t everyone else see this as an 8 score like I did :(   Great job! ', '2006-11-29 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071430, 430196, 66384, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, and awesome result. Hard to believe not a single 1, 2, or 3 rating. Almost never see that.</td>', 'Awesome shot, and awesome result. Hard to believe not a single 1, 2, or 3 rating. Almost never see that.', '2006-11-29 10:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071443, 430459, 31443, '<td valign="top">So simple yet so effective and pleasing to the eye, wonderful place to go to work to!</td>', 'So simple yet so effective and pleasing to the eye, wonderful place to go to work to!', '2006-11-29 10:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071504, 429245, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne,<br/>I love this shot! It is so humorous and the focus / exposure are just right. I think you should be happy it is included in your profile, as it is very clever and funny.</td>', 'Julianne,I love this shot! It is so humorous and the focus / exposure are just right. I think you should be happy it is included in your profile, as it is very clever and funny.', '2006-11-29 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071515, 428766, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeff,<br/>Wonderful perspective and curves in this photo. I think the only dampening factor is the lighting, which I realize was probably just about impossible in this location (been there myself a few times). Unfortunately, the bright footlamps draw attention away from the beautiful soft lines. Overall really nice shot, though.</td>', 'Jeff,Wonderful perspective and curves in this photo. I think the only dampening factor is the lighting, which I realize was probably just about impossible in this location (been there myself a few times). Unfortunately, the bright footlamps draw attention away from the beautiful soft lines. Overall really nice shot, though.', '2006-11-29 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071526, 430196, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/>What can I say? This most assuredly does NOT suck :-) In fact, it is a gorgeous photo with wonderful perspective. I am especially impressed with the lighting - you managed to avoid any blown highlights in spite of all those whites.</td>', 'Deb,What can I say? This most assuredly does NOT suck :-) In fact, it is a gorgeous photo with wonderful perspective. I am especially impressed with the lighting - you managed to avoid any blown highlights in spite of all those whites.', '2006-11-29 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071532, 429245, 51538, '<td valign="top">I thought this was an entertaining image as I voted through (gave it a 6).  Nice sense of humour.</td>', 'I thought this was an entertaining image as I voted through (gave it a 6).  Nice sense of humour.', '2006-11-29 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071535, 430320, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think you got a little bit robbed score-wise on this photo. I suspect the cut-off lamppost may have dragged score down, as it takes away from the composition somewhat. In fact, I''d love to see this photo with just that front lamppost cloned out.<br/> <br/>Otherwise- stunning sky and great sharp focus.</td>', 'I think you got a little bit robbed score-wise on this photo. I suspect the cut-off lamppost may have dragged score down, as it takes away from the composition somewhat. In fact, I''d love to see this photo with just that front lamppost cloned out. Otherwise- stunning sky and great sharp focus.', '2006-11-29 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071541, 429528, 51538, '<td valign="top">The story behind the photo makes it come alive a little more.  Nice work.  You got a 7 from me during voting and I am glad to see many agreed that yours is a nice photo.</td>', 'The story behind the photo makes it come alive a little more.  Nice work.  You got a 7 from me during voting and I am glad to see many agreed that yours is a nice photo.', '2006-11-29 10:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071545, 430282, 51538, '<td valign="top">You have a Midas touch.  I swear that if I had submitted this photo, it would have been way down in the 4 point somethings.  Glad, though, your photo was appreciated by the masses.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-29 10:44:45.</i></td>', 'You have a Midas touch.  I swear that if I had submitted this photo, it would have been way down in the 4 point somethings.  Glad, though, your photo was appreciated by the masses.', '2006-11-29 10:44:30.000000', '2006-11-29 10:44:45.000000', 0),
(3071547, 428359, 7969, '<td valign="top">another great shot, and ribbon!! congrats!</td>', 'another great shot, and ribbon!! congrats!', '2006-11-29 10:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071553, 430349, 51538, '<td valign="top">I did rather think this was Coney Island.  I keep meaning to go out there - but the trek on the F train sends me to sleep...  Nice result.</td>', 'I did rather think this was Coney Island.  I keep meaning to go out there - but the trek on the F train sends me to sleep...  Nice result.', '2006-11-29 10:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071555, 430240, 66597, '<td valign="top">I totally disagree with the DNMC comment. The curves in the back definitely add interesting perspective to this shot. I also like the colors you chose and how well they contrast without clashing. On the other hand, I''m not sure the composition is as strong as it could be. I would love to see this shot with the jacks at a diagonal.</td>', 'I totally disagree with the DNMC comment. The curves in the back definitely add interesting perspective to this shot. I also like the colors you chose and how well they contrast without clashing. On the other hand, I''m not sure the composition is as strong as it could be. I would love to see this shot with the jacks at a diagonal.', '2006-11-29 10:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071563, 429544, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice result - hoped it might be higher... but such is life.  Lovely location.</td>', 'Nice result - hoped it might be higher... but such is life.  Lovely location.', '2006-11-29 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071570, 428662, 51538, '<td valign="top">You did deserve better.  But the number of comments show that your photo received due attention.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'You did deserve better.  But the number of comments show that your photo received due attention.  Keep up the good work.', '2006-11-29 10:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071573, 429245, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is fun and delightful. I only gave it a 6. I guess my sense of humor was lacking at the time. It also is an excellent example of perspective and its importance to the image.</td>', 'This is fun and delightful. I only gave it a 6. I guess my sense of humor was lacking at the time. It also is an excellent example of perspective and its importance to the image.', '2006-11-29 10:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071575, 430476, 51538, '<td valign="top">That must be a pretty old horse to get beaten by a cow.</td>', 'That must be a pretty old horse to get beaten by a cow.', '2006-11-29 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071578, 430481, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty good result yet again with that Bridge.  Well done.  Down under the  bridge is pretty interesting too...</td>', 'Pretty good result yet again with that Bridge.  Well done.  Down under the  bridge is pretty interesting too...', '2006-11-29 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071588, 429755, 51538, '<td valign="top">I was wondering what the ap was on this shot.  Given the stars, I thought it might be in the 22 range. Nice work.</td>', 'I was wondering what the ap was on this shot.  Given the stars, I thought it might be in the 22 range. Nice work.', '2006-11-29 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071589, 429529, 24715, '<td valign="top">You got robbed. I can''t stop coming back to this image.</td>', 'You got robbed. I can''t stop coming back to this image.', '2006-11-29 10:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071593, 430281, 51538, '<td valign="top">Blackpool, forsaken by the (New) Labour Party, but redeemed by mimid in a DPC challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Blackpool, forsaken by the (New) Labour Party, but redeemed by mimid in a DPC challenge.  Well done.', '2006-11-29 10:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071598, 430229, 51538, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo and a heck of a title.  Nice to be able to use words like that and see them used.</td>', 'A lovely photo and a heck of a title.  Nice to be able to use words like that and see them used.', '2006-11-29 10:54:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071600, 429736, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  That lens is pretty adaptable, is it not.  I wonder how your photo would look like in duotone?</td>', 'Nice work.  That lens is pretty adaptable, is it not.  I wonder how your photo would look like in duotone?', '2006-11-29 10:55:27.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3071601, 429605, 44575, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a couple of problems here.  Given your intent, you haven''t zoomed in close enough -- the print is so small that I can''t read any passages, or even reliably identify the book as the Bible.  While you''ve blurred the presents, they so recede into the background that they look more like accidental distractions than part of the intended composition. The presents might have had more impact if you''d kept this in color and lost the manger scene, which is not needed given the other elements.  The lamp doesn''t add anything to the composition or your intended message, IMO.  <br/> <br/>I think this could be greatly improved by getting up close to the Bible, so that just PART of the passage (but enough to identify it) you want is in the photo.   Maybe but the Bible a flatter angle, but I''d have to play with it to see what''s the best position.  Bring the presents in a bit closer, so they''re more a part of the composition.  Lose the manger scene.  This arrangement also adds a VISUAL aspect to "perspective" which I think would score better than a photo based just on a more abstract definition of perspectiveas you''ve done here.<br/> <br/></td>', 'You''ve got a couple of problems here.  Given your intent, you haven''t zoomed in close enough -- the print is so small that I can''t read any passages, or even reliably identify the book as the Bible.  While you''ve blurred the presents, they so recede into the background that they look more like accidental distractions than part of the intended composition. The presents might have had more impact if you''d kept this in color and lost the manger scene, which is not needed given the other elements.  The lamp doesn''t add anything to the composition or your intended message, IMO.   I think this could be greatly improved by getting up close to the Bible, so that just PART of the passage (but enough to identify it) you want is in the photo.   Maybe but the Bible a flatter angle, but I''d have to play with it to see what''s the best position.  Bring the presents in a bit closer, so they''re more a part of the composition.  Lose the manger scene.  This arrangement also adds a VISUAL aspect to "perspective" which I think would score better than a photo based just on a more abstract definition of perspectiveas you''ve done here. ', '2006-11-29 10:55:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071612, 430383, 51538, '<td valign="top">The stats are interesting.  Both park benches were above 6 in the challenge.  People cannot resist park benches... for future note.  Well done.</td>', 'The stats are interesting.  Both park benches were above 6 in the challenge.  People cannot resist park benches... for future note.  Well done.', '2006-11-29 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071640, 428767, 51538, '<td valign="top">A good image by any standard.  Hard to be fully appreciated in the context of a competition though.</td>', 'A good image by any standard.  Hard to be fully appreciated in the context of a competition though.', '2006-11-29 11:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071657, 430363, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think this is my overall favourite from the challenge.  Much under appreciated.  Keep up the good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-29 11:28:14.</i></td>', 'I think this is my overall favourite from the challenge.  Much under appreciated.  Keep up the good work.', '2006-11-29 11:09:33.000000', '2006-11-29 11:28:14.000000', 0),
(3071662, 429962, 51538, '<td valign="top">Still like this one a lot.  Lovely atmosphere to the photo.</td>', 'Still like this one a lot.  Lovely atmosphere to the photo.', '2006-11-29 11:10:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071666, 429328, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very James Bond to me.  Wished it had done a bit better.</td>', 'Very James Bond to me.  Wished it had done a bit better.', '2006-11-29 11:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071673, 428745, 51538, '<td valign="top">Weatherwise the sky has been difficult of late.  You did well.  I did not guess it was of the Verazzano.</td>', 'Weatherwise the sky has been difficult of late.  You did well.  I did not guess it was of the Verazzano.', '2006-11-29 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071699, 429815, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Congrats on the high score, absolutely stunning image :o)</td>', 'Great picture. Congrats on the high score, absolutely stunning image :o)', '2006-11-29 11:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071706, 430459, 57886, '<td valign="top">You did it again.... Stunning image David. Great perspective.. :o)</td>', 'You did it again.... Stunning image David. Great perspective.. :o)', '2006-11-29 11:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071710, 430323, 36606, '<td valign="top">awesome shot man.</td>', 'awesome shot man.', '2006-11-29 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071715, 430270, 19944, '<td valign="top">So, Brad, you commented that mine should finish Top 5.  So congratulations on your 7th place finish!  ; - )<br/> <br/>I really like this shot.  I love that he''s in a dress shirt and tie.  Makes me wonder what the heck is going on.</td>', 'So, Brad, you commented that mine should finish Top 5.  So congratulations on your 7th place finish!  ; - ) I really like this shot.  I love that he''s in a dress shirt and tie.  Makes me wonder what the heck is going on.', '2006-11-29 11:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071770, 430262, 22872, '<td valign="top">i love this puppy!!! :)<br/></td>', 'i love this puppy!!! :)', '2006-11-29 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071798, 430166, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a great landmark... good work...</td>', 'Nice shot of a great landmark... good work...', '2006-11-29 11:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071801, 429144, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture and what a start :o) My postcard entry was taken in Iceland but I named it Antarctica beach... did not expect to see pictures realy taken there, but you never know...</td>', 'Great picture and what a start :o) My postcard entry was taken in Iceland but I named it Antarctica beach... did not expect to see pictures realy taken there, but you never know...', '2006-11-29 11:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071825, 430293, 7786, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the positive and constructive comments. I am quite pleased with the results after at rather disapointing last few challenges.</td>', 'Thanks for all the positive and constructive comments. I am quite pleased with the results after at rather disapointing last few challenges.', '2006-11-29 11:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071885, 428881, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great shot Alice. I''ve not visited this place but it looks interesting.</td>', 'Great shot Alice. I''ve not visited this place but it looks interesting.', '2006-11-29 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071888, 430476, 42013, '<td valign="top">He wins for good looks.</td>', 'He wins for good looks.', '2006-11-29 12:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071898, 429880, 42013, '<td valign="top">The song is nice but where is the collection of unrelated reading material?</td>', 'The song is nice but where is the collection of unrelated reading material?', '2006-11-29 12:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071900, 430259, 42013, '<td valign="top">I almost picture this as a reflection. Great shot.</td>', 'I almost picture this as a reflection. Great shot.', '2006-11-29 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071918, 428359, 7778, '<td valign="top">The shot leaves me with the same expression as ''mom''s''. Fabulous with a fitting title too.</td>', 'The shot leaves me with the same expression as ''mom''s''. Fabulous with a fitting title too.', '2006-11-29 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071942, 429252, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nobody sees happy in this picture. I do too!</td>', 'Nobody sees happy in this picture. I do too!', '2006-11-29 12:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071948, 430014, 42013, '<td valign="top">U2 rocks! Great, grand, concert shot.</td>', 'U2 rocks! Great, grand, concert shot.', '2006-11-29 12:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071963, 428766, 31133, '<td valign="top">WOW, I like this one much better than the postcard shot (but that one''s nice, too :-). Congratulations on two really great challenge entries and high scores! This is really nice the way the composition emphasizes the curves of the pillars. Way to go!</td>', 'WOW, I like this one much better than the postcard shot (but that one''s nice, too :-). Congratulations on two really great challenge entries and high scores! This is really nice the way the composition emphasizes the curves of the pillars. Way to go!', '2006-11-29 12:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071976, 429529, 50695, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe you got DNMC comments for this photo. sigh.</td>', 'I cannot believe you got DNMC comments for this photo. sigh.', '2006-11-29 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071996, 428881, 66353, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice Alice - and congrats on your 21st place :)</td>', 'Very, very nice Alice - and congrats on your 21st place :)', '2006-11-29 12:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3071997, 428766, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice and great for the challenge.  Isn''t that an amazing place? Not only just to photograph at night but the whole vibe of it.  It''s one of those places that gives you goosebumps as soon as you step foot onto the grounds.  Congrats on the great score! :)</td>', 'Very nice and great for the challenge.  Isn''t that an amazing place? Not only just to photograph at night but the whole vibe of it.  It''s one of those places that gives you goosebumps as soon as you step foot onto the grounds.  Congrats on the great score! :)', '2006-11-29 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072021, 430335, 20462, '<td valign="top">You make good points about the necessary high perspective to achieve the proper DOF and bokeh.  Especially in basic editing.  You have had better portraits though, to be honest.  But at the very least, perhaps you will reinvigorate viewers to study images just a few seconds longer to appreciate the photographers who do try to stretch the mind.</td>', 'You make good points about the necessary high perspective to achieve the proper DOF and bokeh.  Especially in basic editing.  You have had better portraits though, to be honest.  But at the very least, perhaps you will reinvigorate viewers to study images just a few seconds longer to appreciate the photographers who do try to stretch the mind.', '2006-11-29 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072156, 429152, 60862, '<td valign="top">*laugh*  This is VERY VERY VERY clever.  It takes a rare mind to grasp that animals frying themselves actually benefits someone.  I also appreciate the different meaning of perspective as a mental model of the world, as opposed to a literal physical viewpoint.  I tried to incorporate that into my entry, too.<br/> <br/>As a photo, the composition feels a little off.  Not quite sure why.  I think I expect the hawk to be facing into the frame instead of out of it.  But I can imagine you didn''t have much time to take this shot!  Just something to think about when shooting in the future.</td>', '*laugh*  This is VERY VERY VERY clever.  It takes a rare mind to grasp that animals frying themselves actually benefits someone.  I also appreciate the different meaning of perspective as a mental model of the world, as opposed to a literal physical viewpoint.  I tried to incorporate that into my entry, too. As a photo, the composition feels a little off.  Not quite sure why.  I think I expect the hawk to be facing into the frame instead of out of it.  But I can imagine you didn''t have much time to take this shot!  Just something to think about when shooting in the future.', '2006-11-29 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072164, 430196, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another spec-frickin''-tacular shot, Deb! Congrats on the top 20 placement, too.  We''ve both had a good couple of weeks with new high scores, eh? :)<br/> <br/>I just love the off-center, asymmetrical view.</td>', 'Another spec-frickin''-tacular shot, Deb! Congrats on the top 20 placement, too.  We''ve both had a good couple of weeks with new high scores, eh? :) I just love the off-center, asymmetrical view.', '2006-11-29 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072334, 429814, 61654, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh, my favorite game. Wish I had a board in my home!  Welcome to DPC. This shot has got great focus on the bull which I like. And a great score for your second entry! As far as post processing goes on this shot, I think I would have made the actual dart stand out a bit more.  Perhaps light coming in from the side directed on the dart.  The color on the bull is great but the rest of the board is kind of blah.  Play around with level, brightness/contrast, curves, selective color, etc. Make the blacks blacker and whites whiter giving it more oomf. A bit more shinyness (is that a word?) on the silver lines would have been cool too. I have never actually critiqued a photo since I am relatively new to this myself, but I hope it was of some help. Good luck in future challenges.</td>', 'Ahhhh, my favorite game. Wish I had a board in my home!  Welcome to DPC. This shot has got great focus on the bull which I like. And a great score for your second entry! As far as post processing goes on this shot, I think I would have made the actual dart stand out a bit more.  Perhaps light coming in from the side directed on the dart.  The color on the bull is great but the rest of the board is kind of blah.  Play around with level, brightness/contrast, curves, selective color, etc. Make the blacks blacker and whites whiter giving it more oomf. A bit more shinyness (is that a word?) on the silver lines would have been cool too. I have never actually critiqued a photo since I am relatively new to this myself, but I hope it was of some help. Good luck in future challenges.', '2006-11-29 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072390, 430047, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, Steve! I like this point of view a lot.</td>', 'Nice tones, Steve! I like this point of view a lot.', '2006-11-29 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
