(3073533, 429397, 45475, '<td valign="top">Kelly, you''re a thinker. There should be more like you here. For the most part, unfortunately, you have to smack the voters over the head with your message. Had I voted in this challenge, I''d have given you a 5. Not because I didn''t get it (I do), or thought it dnmc (it isn''t), but purely from a technical point for the focus and lighting. I dare say, if the focus was better and the light wasn''t so harsh, your score would have looked a little healthier.<br/> <br/>But at the end of the day, I suspect you''re not terribly fixated on scores or wanting to sell your soul to the dpc hype :) So always do what YOU want to do.</td>', 'Kelly, you''re a thinker. There should be more like you here. For the most part, unfortunately, you have to smack the voters over the head with your message. Had I voted in this challenge, I''d have given you a 5. Not because I didn''t get it (I do), or thought it dnmc (it isn''t), but purely from a technical point for the focus and lighting. I dare say, if the focus was better and the light wasn''t so harsh, your score would have looked a little healthier. But at the end of the day, I suspect you''re not terribly fixated on scores or wanting to sell your soul to the dpc hype :) So always do what YOU want to do.', '2006-11-29 19:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3073543, 429127, 3071, '<td valign="top">You''re right, I didn''t even consider where it was leading too. And you point about the plastic bag is well taken, next time I''ll have to pay more attention to details like that.  Thaks for your input.</td>', 'You''re right, I didn''t even consider where it was leading too. And you point about the plastic bag is well taken, next time I''ll have to pay more attention to details like that.  Thaks for your input.', '2006-11-29 19:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
