(3074067, 430299, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hi there.  Told ya I wanted to see your photo to get an idea of what you meant by "perspective lighting."<br/> <br/>Okay, I still don''t get what you meant.  Perspective really does have a few specific meanings.  Take a look at the highly-scoring ones to get an understanding of it.<br/> <br/>That said, this is a cool photo.  I like the light coming through the bulb.  Keep shooting and keep entering challenges! :)</td>', 'Hi there.  Told ya I wanted to see your photo to get an idea of what you meant by "perspective lighting." Okay, I still don''t get what you meant.  Perspective really does have a few specific meanings.  Take a look at the highly-scoring ones to get an understanding of it. That said, this is a cool photo.  I like the light coming through the bulb.  Keep shooting and keep entering challenges! :)', '2006-11-29 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
