(3080163, 429195, 27763, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  This seems kind of "low contrast", or flat, to me.  I would try darkening the shadows and lightening the highlights with either levels, curves, or simply a brightness/contrast adjustment.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  This seems kind of "low contrast", or flat, to me.  I would try darkening the shadows and lightening the highlights with either levels, curves, or simply a brightness/contrast adjustment.', '2006-12-01 19:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
