(3080270, 430335, 57886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture Lárus. The make up is truly well done and the colors in the pic are great. The votes simply say that sometimes people look to much in their own minds when judging pictures instead of trying to understand what effects the photographer is after :o) Looking forward to your next picture on the front page (sure I don´t have to wait for long ;o)...</td>', 'Beautiful picture Lárus. The make up is truly well done and the colors in the pic are great. The votes simply say that sometimes people look to much in their own minds when judging pictures instead of trying to understand what effects the photographer is after :o) Looking forward to your next picture on the front page (sure I don´t have to wait for long ;o)...', '2006-12-01 20:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
