(3157505, 429936, 31606, '<td valign="top">You entered this in a perspective challenge?  To me this is not an interesting perspective.  A better perspective would be if thedog were standing up and looking up at the dog.  Maybe even a wide abngle lens if you could use it.  Look at the top two in that challenge and see the differences.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'You entered this in a perspective challenge?  To me this is not an interesting perspective.  A better perspective would be if thedog were standing up and looking up at the dog.  Maybe even a wide abngle lens if you could use it.  Look at the top two in that challenge and see the differences.  Hope this helps.', '2006-12-28 21:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160034, 429936, 46177, '<td valign="top">OK, well maybe I agree that the perspective challenge was not the ideal place to enter this as you know some people always go out and get such dramatic shots.  Having said that I still love this picture, The dog is cute, love the black background and yes nice perspective.</td>', 'OK, well maybe I agree that the perspective challenge was not the ideal place to enter this as you know some people always go out and get such dramatic shots.  Having said that I still love this picture, The dog is cute, love the black background and yes nice perspective.', '2006-12-29 15:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
