(3508455, 428668, 69008, '<td valign="top">The f 2.8 caused the need for the sudden shutter speed. I assume that you used the big aperture for shallow depth of field, to put the sun out of focus? <br/>I shoot into the sun a lot too, and like the orange in this image, and that the tree is in good focus. <br/>Keep shooting and keep learning.</td>', 'The f 2.8 caused the need for the sudden shutter speed. I assume that you used the big aperture for shallow depth of field, to put the sun out of focus? I shoot into the sun a lot too, and like the orange in this image, and that the tree is in good focus. Keep shooting and keep learning.', '2007-04-02 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
